      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>He asks that benefaction be extended to him, and [kindness be shown to him]</li>\n<li>and the issuance of the noble decree, may God increase its efficacy</li>\n<li>and greatness, by releasing it for them</li>\n<li>And to his eminence, may God increase his strength belongs [the lofty resolution]</li>\n<li>]regarding this if God wills. Written on [</li>\n<li>Dh\u016b l-Qa\u02bfda, in the year 458/508/580</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
